{"type":"text","timestamp":1773239829075,"sessionID":"ses_322ab9e5dffeYhqlgaGUQlEKV6","part":{"id":"prt_cdd547f7c001CSnU17q1C4mgQX","sessionID":"ses_322ab9e5dffeYhqlgaGUQlEKV6","messageID":"msg_cdd54626a001S8hUNlHGVYlNBY","type":"text","text":"The pipeline analyzes 1000 Genomes Project data to identify mutational overlaps among individuals across different populations. It computes SIFT scores for SNPs using VEP annotations and measures mutation overlap between pairs of individuals by chromosome and population. The results provide a **null distribution for rigorous statistical evaluation of potential disease-related mutations**.","time":{"start":1773239829069,"end":1773239829069}}}
